## Verification Rule

- active, blocked, or recently completed execution work belongs in `PLANS.md`
- future tracked work belongs in `docs/codex/TASKS_BACKLOG.md`
- after compaction, interruption, resume, or milestone closure, plan and backlog status should be reconciled before code changes
- active plan status should match post-commit truth before staging or committing
- completed plan detail should be compacted, archived, or removed only after validation and handoff are recorded
- retained historical plan trees are detail only, not canonical
